WEBVTT

00:01:47.021 --> 00:01:50.517
Soul Contract

00:01:52.635 --> 00:01:55.315
17th Contract

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:58.620
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:04.540
The sun will rise after 1 hour

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.540
If Yangming Master doesn't return

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:08.520
It will be a disaster

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:12.000
The rest is up to the Duamu family now

00:02:32.843 --> 00:02:33.955
Duanmu Xi

00:02:33.955 --> 00:02:35.545
Hey, Duanmu Xi

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:40.480
It feels so good

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:43.130
Nothing is more awesome than revenge

00:02:43.135 --> 00:02:45.634
Tonight will be your time to die

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:48.500
Do all antagonists always give similar speeches?

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.800
Cut the crap

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.930
Prepare to get wrecked hard by the Luoye Sword in my hand

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:57.614
Losers only know how to yap like a puppy

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:00.460
Why

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:02.600
Your sword skill has improved a lot

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.170
I'm not like before

00:03:04.173 --> 00:03:05.579
I'm improving too

00:03:05.579 --> 00:03:07.098
I fooled you

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:08.900
No way, I underestimated him

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:10.680
His target is Duanmu Xi

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.400
Farewell, Yangming Master

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.560
Duanmu Xi

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.000
Two defeated losers,

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.780
let's see how far you can run

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.500
Duanmu

00:03:38.505 --> 00:03:39.610
Hang on

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:40.961
We're almost home

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.550
Duanmu Xi,

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.330
I never expect

00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:54.721
you'd run with your tail between your legs

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:59.920
You never thought your chosen Soul Image would seal your power, eh?

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.860
Spirit Manipulator is the bane of Soul Image

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:02.640
Don't be rash

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.680
Then what should we do?

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:10.510
I can only use the most basic talisman spell to fight him

00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:14.734
How do I say the prose?

00:04:14.734 --> 00:04:16.573
Rearing tigers to invite trouble;

00:04:16.573 --> 00:04:18.717
Allowing wolves to enter the room

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:31.120
You both are the most reckless pair I've ever met

00:04:33.123 --> 00:04:35.431
Time for me to finish you off

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.430
Where are they?

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:42.600
Duanmu Xi

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.940
Stop fooling around

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:48.290
I got no mood...

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.560
Why can't we take him down?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.800
The talismans can only temporary hold him off

00:05:00.008 --> 00:05:02.784
Besides, I don't have any power to fight him now

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.280
Duanmu Xi

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:12.530
Your Sifu said sealing the sword to regain your power is the 2nd choice

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:13.800
So, what's the 1st choice?

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:15.710
You don't need to know

00:05:15.711 --> 00:05:19.221
It's to make me disappear, isn't it?

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:22.300
Then, just eradicate me and take back your power

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.540
Stop trying to hide

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.860
You're a Yangming Master honored by millions of people

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.930
You don't deserve to be abused

00:05:36.221 --> 00:05:37.331
Shut up

00:05:39.071 --> 00:05:42.281
From start till now, I never put the blame on you

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:47.020
It's because you never blame me,

00:05:47.021 --> 00:05:48.501
I get more...

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.310
Duanmu Xi

00:05:58.060 --> 00:05:59.280
So frustrating

00:05:59.286 --> 00:06:02.155
I can't stand being a fine lady anymore

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:04.220
If I can't get out through the window,

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.910
then I'll go through the main door

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.020
For Duanmu,

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:09.920
I'll do anything to get out

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.340
At that moment, he's already...?

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:28.980
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:30.923
You withstand till now?

00:06:32.203 --> 00:06:33.122
Jinghua

00:06:33.122 --> 00:06:34.403
Listen to me

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.500
He will catch up with us soon

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.500
You go first

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.780
Don't worry about me

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.180
You shut up

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:41.794
Call the ambulance

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.460
Must stop the bleeding quick

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:47.730
You...

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.520
We secretly snuck out

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:53.486
No one should find me looking like this

00:06:53.725 --> 00:06:55.172
You asked me before

00:06:55.172 --> 00:06:57.800
Why I'm so concerned about my power

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.891
This power is my birthright

00:06:59.891 --> 00:07:01.470
Other than to use it,

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.850
I've got no other means to survive

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:05.586
After I lose my power,

00:07:05.586 --> 00:07:07.627
I lost the purpose of my life

00:07:07.627 --> 00:07:09.502
Do you understand?

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:14.330
I kind of understand him now

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.280
He constantly used great power

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.320
by putting up a brave front

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:20.680
Once that power is stripped away,

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.380
he would be at a loss too

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.540
Fear

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.850
Uneased

00:07:24.852 --> 00:07:26.411
He is not god

00:07:26.411 --> 00:07:28.807
He is just a regular person

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.920
Just like us, a normal person

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.440
Didn't you say,

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:34.400
if you die,

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.920
I'll be gone too?

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:38.040
I won't run away without you

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.420
It was a lie

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:44.380
This tassel was weaved with my fetal hair

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.790
It contains my life force

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:48.460
Even if I'm gone,

00:07:48.461 --> 00:07:52.407
you'll never disappear as long as you wear it

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.670
You should go now

00:07:53.672 --> 00:07:57.100
I can no longer protect you anymore

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.611
How can I leave?

00:07:58.611 --> 00:08:02.926
Have you forgotten about the radius of 60-meter boundary limit?

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.850
From now on,

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.093
you're free

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:23.908
You two are hiding here having intimate moment

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:29.660
You think you can trap me with a formation of talismans

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:30.760
Think again

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:32.690
Let me protect you this time

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.530
Leave

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.210
Duanmu Xi

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.320
You should leave

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.750
This is an order

00:08:46.145 --> 00:08:48.751
Remember the things you promised me

00:08:48.751 --> 00:08:49.909
My lord

00:08:49.909 --> 00:08:50.650
Why?

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:53.200
Everything has an end

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:57.010
Perhaps, this is my ending

00:08:58.360 --> 00:08:59.460
My lord

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.380
Lord Luoye

00:09:14.058 --> 00:09:16.140
You're such a mess

00:09:16.156 --> 00:09:18.280
What did you promise me?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.140
Yinzhe

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.440
Why are you here?

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.680
I should be the one asking you

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.440
Don't you want to protect him?

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:26.620
Why he dumps you here instead?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.270
Duanmu Xi wanted to protect me so...

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.173
Oh yeah

00:09:30.173 --> 00:09:31.463
You can save him

00:09:31.463 --> 00:09:32.657
Hurry up and save him

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:33.800
He's dying

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:34.860
What's wrong?

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.417
Didn't you care a lot about him?

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:37.500
Bastard

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.150
I would've gone to save him if I could

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:41.340
Unfortunately,

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:44.740
I can't leave the mountain behind Duanmu's home

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.470
Then I'll go

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.380
If you run like this,

00:09:54.384 --> 00:09:56.875
his corpse would be cold by now

00:09:56.875 --> 00:09:58.562
Then what do you expect me to do?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.790
Look at your sword

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.590
Luoye Sword

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:06.510
What can you feel?

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.260
It tries to control me through hallucinations

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:11.390
Making me to kill Duanmu Xi

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:13.114
but I won't let it happen again

00:10:13.114 --> 00:10:14.908
I ain't gonna let it control me

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:21.900
Listen up

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:24.860
Every sword is filled with the swordsmiths' passion

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:26.650
So is the Luoye Sword

00:10:26.653 --> 00:10:28.247
To properly use this sword,

00:10:28.247 --> 00:10:30.139
you mustn't detest it

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:32.980
Learn to understand what it's meant for

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.960
My lord

00:10:35.076 --> 00:10:36.664
My lord!

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:38.100
This is

00:10:38.108 --> 00:10:40.063
Yangning's passion

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.100
Go now

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:46.320
Things have changed drastically between you and me

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:48.310
You are free

00:10:55.028 --> 00:10:56.345
My lord

00:10:56.345 --> 00:10:58.237
You're mistaken

00:10:58.237 --> 00:11:00.842
I've already given up my freedom

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:03.920
I shall fulfill what you entrusted me

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:06.450
If this is your ending,

00:11:06.456 --> 00:11:08.263
then I...

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.920
In order to stop Duanmu Luoye from massacring

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.630
and turning evil

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:26.440
Yangning ripped off an arm to forge the sword

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.400
Since then,

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.420
the sword never left his side

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:34.300
Even if things have completely changed

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:38.780
There's only one place I desire to go

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:41.330
It's to be with you

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:52.609
Who...?!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.390
I will never leave you
